          "type": null,
          "body": "Packet capture file demonstrating the fix\n[rtitcp-large-data-reassembly.pcapng](/uploads/0de972bccc8d6126bc2c3c4702874a05/rtitcp-large-data-reassembly.pcapng)\n\nFixing this defect revealed another issue which will be fixed in a separate merge request, so with this fix only, Frame 503 will show the correct reassembly, but there is an error that occurs due to a bounds defect.\n\nFrame 65 before fix\n![image](/uploads/6ea38843c08efb092f221f0659d1a314/image.png){width=900 height=402}\n\nFrame 65 after fix\n![image](/uploads/c8f1b90ef40d3af1706a8e77ef8ea241/image.png){width=900 height=556}\n\nFrame 503 before fix\n![image](/uploads/65973c0aa5cce73d373a3794119680b4/image.png){width=900 height=593}\n\nFrame 503 after fix\n![image](/uploads/9fbd894e278a5582290e0f84f82aa599/image.png){width=708 height=600}",
